  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "6.0.0: AutoMapper API parity (IMapper, Profile, ResolutionContext, IValueResolver, ITypeConverter, IValueConverter, IMappingAction, AddAutoMapper alias, VeloxMapper.QueryableExtensions), ReverseMap chaining, MapFrom with any source type, Map(source, destination) returns destination and maps nested objects in place, transient IMapper with scoped DI, per-profile conventions, EF Core ProjectTo fixes. See https://veloxmapper-website.netlify.app/docs/changelog",
